+++ b/releasenotes/notes/fix-retry-composition-plain-callable-b0320d967e9e5b81.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    Fixed a regression since 8.4.2 where combining a retry strategy with a plain
+    callable using ``|`` or ``&`` (in either order) raised ``AttributeError``
+    instead of producing ``retry_any`` or ``retry_all``. Composition with plain
+    callables works again for both sync and async retry strategies.
